[size=5][b]Permissions and source[/b][/size]

Skyrim Together Reborn is open source under the GNU GPL v3, and so is this build. Source code: [url=https://github.com/mailamea10/TiltedEvolution-dwmapi.dll]github.com/mailamea10/TiltedEvolution-dwmapi.dll[/url] (branch [font=Courier New]feature/legacy-1.5.97-on-1.8.5[/font]).
